sentences.text:
37. In the totality of circumstances, the Applicant Manoj Gupta S/o Radhe Shyam Gupta is admitted to bail in the present case on his furnishing bailbond in the sum of Rs. 35,000/- with one surety in the like amount to the satisfaction of the Trial Court, subject to the following conditions:
(i) The Applicant shall not misuse the liberty granted to him;
(ii) The Applicant shall not tamper with any evidence, oral or documentary during the trial;
(iii) The Applicant shall not go even in the vicinity of the house and workplace of the prosecutrix;
(iv) The Applicant shall appear before the Trial Court on every date of hearing; and (v) That Applicant shall keep the SHO/IO informed about his mobile number and the address.

